{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"85119","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/85119","key":"MC-59626","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"29/Jun/14 1:03 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p>Arrows that were shot by a bow that is enchanted with a punch enchantment do not remember their punch property when being unloaded (for example by logging out).</p>\n\n<p>How to reproduce:</p>\n\n<p>1. Get yourself a Punch II Bow and some arrows</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">/give @s minecraft:bow{Enchantments:[{id:<span class=\"code-quote\">\"minecraft:punch\"</span>,lvl:2s}]}\n/give @s minecraft:arrow 64\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>2. Place two dirt blocks beside each other in the air so that there are four blocks space between the floor and the blocks.<br>\n3. Go into survival mode if you aren't already<br>\n4. Shoot an arrow with the Punch II into the underside of each block.<br>\n5. Stand below the first block and mine it so that the arrow falls and hits you.<br>\n6. You will be thrown away quite a bit.<br>\n7. Log out.<br>\n8. Log back in and wait a few seconds because the player is invulnerable for a few seconds after login.<br>\n9. Stand below the second block and mine it so that the arrow falls and hits you.<br>\n10. When the arrow hits you, you will be knocked back only a little (as much as a normal Arrow does).</p>\n\n<p>This behavior is expected since there is no NBT-Tag implemented in which the punch property is saved in.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"14/Nov/15 5:47 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[],"versions":null,"resolutiondate":"30/Apr/24 1:48 AM","issuelinks":null,"updated":"27/Aug/26 12:22 AM","status":null},"fields":{"summary":"Arrows lose their Punch enchantment property when unloaded","issuetype":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issuetype/10006","id":"10006","description":"A problem which impairs or prevents the functions of the product. (Migrated on 23 Jan 2025 19:08 UTC)","iconUrl":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium","name":"Bug","subtask":false,"avatarId":10303,"hierarchyLevel":0},"watches":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/MC-59626/watchers","watchCount":1,"isWatching":false},"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":null,"created":"2014-06-29T13:03:28.999-0700","customfield_10050":null,"customfield_10051":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/customFieldOption/10098","value":"Platform","id":"10098"},"description":{"type":"doc","version":1,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrows that were shot by a bow that is enchanted with a punch enchantment do not remember their punch property when being unloaded (for example by logging out)."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"How to reproduce:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"1. Get yourself a Punch II Bow and some arrows"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"java"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"/give @s minecraft:bow{Enchantments:[{id:\"minecraft:punch\",lvl:2s}]}\n/give @s minecraft:arrow 64"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2. Place two dirt blocks beside each other in the air so that there are four blocks space between the floor and the blocks."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"3. Go into survival mode if you aren't already"},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"4. Shoot an arrow with the Punch II into the underside of each block."},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"5. Stand below the first block and mine it so that the arrow falls and hits you."},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"6. You will be thrown away quite a bit."},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"7. Log out."},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"8. Log back in and wait a few seconds because the player is invulnerable for a few seconds after login."},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"9. Stand below the second block and mine it so that the arrow falls and hits you."},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"10. When the arrow hits you, you will be knocked back only a little (as much as a normal Arrow does)."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This behavior is expected since there is no NBT-Tag implemented in which the punch property is saved in."}]}]},"customfield_10054":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/customFieldOption/10023","value":"Confirmed","id":"10023"},"fixVersions":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/version/12160","id":"12160","name":"24w18a","archived":true,"released":true,"releaseDate":"2024-05-02"}],"customfield_10055":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/customFieldOption/10050","value":"Entities","id":"10050"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/customFieldOption/10082","value":"Save Data","id":"10082"}],"resolution":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/resolution/10004","id":"10004","description":"A fix for this issue is checked into the tree and tested.","name":"Fixed"},"customfield_10047":"2015-11-14T17:47:00.000-0800","customfield_10048":null,"labels":["arrow","enchantment","punch","unload"],"customfield_10049":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/customFieldOption/10080","value":"Low","id":"10080"},"attachment":[],"versions":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/version/10166","id":"10166","description":"Minecraft development snapshot 14w26c","name":"Minecraft 14w26c","archived":true,"released":true